    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d463">

                <pb facs="0590" n="496" sameAs="frus:frus1930v03/pg496"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">411.12/1063</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Morrow</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-08-07">August 7, 1930</date>.<lb/>[Received, August
                        14.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2678</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit herewith a
                    memorandum prepared by Mr. Lane of this Embassy with respect to remarks made in
                    my presence by the Minister for Foreign Affairs, Señor Genaro Estrada, <pb
                        facs="0591" n="497" xml:id="pg497"/> giving his views in regard to the
                    non-functioning of the Special Claims Commission, United States and Mexico.</p>
                <p>In view of Mr. Estrada’s statements, the importance of an en bloc settlement
                    being reached prior to the expiration of the life of the existing General and
                    Special Claims Conventions<anchor n="28a" xml:id="d463-f1"/> should be
                    emphasized.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dwight W. Morrow</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d463-a1.xml" xpointer="d463-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
